    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
         Icon geometry set — Lucide-derived, 24×24 viewbox, stroke-rendered.

         These are STROKE icons: render with Fill="None", Stroke bound to the
         desired brush, StrokeThickness ≈ 1.75, round caps and joins. The
         `icon` / `icon-sm` style classes in Controls.axaml do this for you.

         Circles are expressed as twin 180° arcs because the SVG path
         mini-language has no circle primitive.
         ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

